    "description": "You might think it’s just a kitecamp 🪁\nBut you leave with stories you’ll be telling for months.\n\nDrink salty water 💦 , ride your first meters, forget your phone exists, take daily siestas, try yoga without overthinking it and leave with those nice night memories talking about your daily experience on the beach while trying to master the kite!\n\nMeet Lea who came for a week Kitesurfing Camp in Tarifa as a Solo Traveler in May.\n\nLearning kitesurfing can be challenging. Every kite spot, ocean, wind, days are different. It is not like tennis or other sports.\n\nThe key? Be patient with yourself, get to know the sea, and above all, have fun. The more you enjoy it, the more you’ll want to keep going.\n\n#tarifa #kiteschool #solotravel #kitesurfing #kiteholiday",
